			"notes": "# v1.0.0\n\nInitial release of the Flashlight Mod.\n\n## What's Included\n\n- Toggleable flashlight item - right-click to turn on/off\n- 16 beam colors via `/flashlight color set <color>`\n- Color preserved across toggles\n- LambDynamicLights integration for dynamic fill lighting\n- Full shader beam, volumetric glow, and dust particles via [Photon Flashlight Fork](https://github.com/StewyDev65/photon-flashlight)\n- Multiplayer support - other players' beams visible in real time\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Minecraft 1.21.1 - Fabric\n- Fabric API\n- LambDynamicLights >= 4.8.7\n- Iris Shaders + Sodium\n- [Photon Flashlight Fork](https://github.com/StewyDev65/photon-flashlight)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Shader beam settings are off by default - enable `FLASHLIGHT` under **Shader Options → Lighting**\n- `FLASHLIGHT_MULTIPLAYER` requires OpenGL 4.3 - not supported on macOS"
		}
